        {
          "text": "Abo boona baikiriize bakaba baine omutima gumwe n'enaama emwe; omuribo tihariho owaabaire aine obunyakantu aha bintu bye, bakaba nibakwatirana omu bintu byabo byona. ",
          "type": "text",
