              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi entumwa zikagira amaani maingi g'okuhamya okuzooka kwa Mukama waitu Yesu; n'embabazi nyingi zaabagumaho boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
